{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-08-29", "prepared_on": "2026-08-29", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-08-29</div>\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Nvidia Reportedly to Acquire AI Model Repository Hugging Face for $13 Billion<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">報導稱 Nvidia 將以 130 億美元收購 AI 模型平台 Hugging Face</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Nvidia is reportedly acquiring Hugging Face, gaining control of critical open-model infrastructure as interest in open-weight AI surges.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">據報導，Nvidia 將收購 AI 模型儲存平台 Hugging Face，把握開放模型的關鍵基礎設施，反映開源模型熱度持續升溫。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/ai/2026/08/report-nvidia-to-acquire-ai-model-repository-hugging-face-for-13-billion/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Trump Blacklisting of \"Woke\" Anthropic Deemed Illegal by Federal Judge<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">聯邦法官裁定川普政府將 Anthropic 列入「覺醒」黑名單違法</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A federal judge ruled the Trump administration's designation was illegal, after Anthropic refused to support lethal autonomous warfare and mass surveillance.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic 因拒絕支援致命自主武器與大規模監控遭川普政府列入黑名單，聯邦法官裁定此舉違法。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/tech-policy/2026/08/trump-blacklisting-of-woke-anthropic-deemed-illegal-by-federal-judge/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> An Anthropic Researcher Just Gave Us a Peek at Self-Improving AI<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic 研究員揭露自我改進 AI 的初步樣貌</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Given 10 benchmarks targeting specific misaligned behaviors, automated systems improved performance on every single one without degrading overall performance.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">針對10項偏差行為基準測試，自動化系統在每一項都成功改善表現，且未損及整體效能。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/28/an-anthropic-researcher-just-gave-us-a-peek-at-self-improving-ai/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> The Cybersecurity Apocalypse Is Coming in 'Months,' AI Giants Warn<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">AI 巨頭示警：網路資安「末日」恐在數月內來臨</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Major AI companies are warning that AI-driven cyberattacks could overwhelm current defenses within months, alongside other pressing security incidents.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">主要 AI 公司警告，AI 驅動的網路攻擊恐在數月內超出現有防禦能力，資安情勢日益嚴峻。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/security-news-this-week-the-cybersecurity-apocalypse-is-coming-in-months-ai-giants-warn/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> Nvidia's AI Advantage Is Moving Beyond the GPU<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Nvidia 的 AI 優勢正從 GPU 延伸到系統整合</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The new generation of data center systems is boosting efficiency through smarter traffic control rather than relying solely on more processor cycles.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">新一代資料中心系統藉由更聰明的流量調度而非單純堆疊運算力來提升效率。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/29/nvidias-ai-advantage-is-moving-beyond-the-gpu/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Jensen Huang Says Nvidia Achieved AGI, Again — Not That It Matters<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">黃仁勳再度宣稱 Nvidia 已達成 AGI，但強調這並不重要</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">On Nvidia's earnings call, CEO Jensen Huang casually declared the company had \"achieved AGI,\" then dismissed the milestone as \"senseless.\"</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Nvidia 執行長黃仁勳在財報電話會議上宣稱公司已達成 AGI，隨即又稱這個里程碑「毫無意義」。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/985597/jensen-huang-says-nvidia-achieved-senseless-agi\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Neocloud Lambda Secures $1B in Debt to Buy More Chips<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">雲端新創 Lambda 募得10億美元債務資金加碼採購晶片</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Lambda raised $1 billion in private debt to purchase Nvidia AI chips and lease them to Microsoft, highlighting the high cost of the AI boom.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Lambda 募得10億美元私募債務資金，用於採購 Nvidia AI 晶片並轉租給微軟，凸顯 AI 熱潮下的高昂成本。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/28/neocloud-lambda-secures-1b-in-debt-to-buy-more-chips/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Anthropic Unveils Model Hardware Standard for AI Agents to Operate Lab Equipment<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic 推出模型硬體標準，讓 AI 代理可直接操作實驗設備</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic's new Model Hardware Standard preview lets AI agents directly control microscopes, robotic arms, and lab instruments for research and manufacturing.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic 推出模型硬體標準研究預覽版，讓 AI 代理可直接操作顯微鏡、機械手臂等實體設備，跨足硬體整合領域。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178508\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> Nearly Half of Enterprise AI Conversations Happen on Personal Accounts, Raising Shadow AI Risk<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">企業AI近5成對話以個人帳號進行，影子AI風險升高</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A survey found nearly half of workplace AI usage occurs through unmanaged personal accounts, leaving much of it outside enterprise security controls.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">調查發現企業員工近半數的 AI 對話透過未受管控的個人帳號進行，恐未納入企業資安控管範圍。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178484\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Cities Terminate Flock Surveillance Contracts at Record Pace in August<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">8月各城市終止 Flock 監控合約速度創新高</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A growing number of US cities are canceling contracts with license-plate surveillance company Flock, with cancellations accelerating sharply this month.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">越來越多美國城市取消與車牌監控業者 Flock 的合約，本月終止速度明顯加快。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/tech-policy/2026/08/cities-terminate-flock-contracts-at-record-pace-in-august/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}